.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK RELEASE ANNOUNCEMENT DRAFT EDIT"
.SH NAME
hamstik release announcement draft edit \- Replace the draft narrative, categories, and included Work Items
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik release announcement draft edit [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Replace the draft narrative, categories, and included Work Items
.SH ARGUMENTS
.TP
.I RELEASE_ID
Release version id (UUID)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --file
JSON file containing `{introduction, highlights, categories, includedWorkItemIds}` (`-` for stdin)
.TP
.B --revision
Draft revision to replace (defaults to the current draft's)
.TP
.B --project
Project key (overrides context)
